%% 存储行业尽调 case 端到端时序图(发起方/执行方 API + 状态流转 + 出入参)
%% 用 draw.io/new 打开 Mermaid 导入,或任意 mermaid 渲染器查看。对应汇报文档 §五。
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 调用方 as 调用方(Test)
    participant TS as TaskService (fold+事件日志)
    participant SCH as TaskScheduler (on_event泵)
    participant OB as owner-bot (plan/discover)
    participant EX as 执行实体 (单bot/群/汇总/终验/BBS)

    Note over 调用方,EX: ═══ Phase A 起跑 + 拆解 ═══
    调用方->>TS: execute_task(T1)
    TS->>SCH: start
    Note right of TS: 入参 task_id=T1 / 出参 TaskOpResult{status=RUNNING,seq=2} / 状态 graph DEFINED→RUNNING; n_root ─→PENDING/decomposing
    SCH-->>OB: dispatch 拆解★OUT {n_root,spec}
    OB->>TS: add_subtasks(n_root, 7子+依赖边)
    TS->>SCH: on_event
    Note right of TS: 入参 parent=n_root, subtasks[1_1,2_1,2_2,2_4,2_5,3_1,3_2] / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[n_root DONE, 5子 searching, 3_1/3_2 pending]} / 状态 n_root decomposing→DONE; 5就绪子 ─→searching; 3_1/3_2 阻塞
    SCH-->>OB: dispatch 搜推★OUT ×5

    Note over 调用方,EX: ═══ Phase B 1_1 单bot: 搜推→执行→自验 ═══
    OB->>TS: apply_search_result(1_1, HIT_single)
    Note right of TS: 入参 recommendation{outcome=HIT,run_mode=SINGLE_BOT,candidates=[bot-A]} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[1_1 executing,assignee=bot-A],dispatch=BotTarget} / 状态 1_1 searching→executing
    SCH-->>EX: dispatch 执行★OUT (bot-A)
    EX->>TS: update_subtask(1_1, execution_result_patch)
    Note right of TS: 入参 NodeInfo{execution_result_patch} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[1_1 executing],dispatch=None} / 状态 1_1 executing(不变); execution_result MERGE(不翻态不drive)
    EX->>TS: update_subtask(1_1, DONE PASS)
    Note right of TS: 入参 NodeInfo{status=DONE,acceptance_result={verdict=PASS,verifier=bot-A}} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[1_1 DONE]} / 状态 1_1 executing→DONE; settle:3_1 deps未满 不drive

    Note over 调用方,EX: ═══ Phase C 2_1协作群 + 2_5递归miss→HUNG ═══
    OB->>TS: apply_search_result(2_1, HIT_coop_group)
    Note right of TS: 入参 recommendation{outcome=HIT,run_mode=COOP_GROUP,group_ref=DynamicGroupSpec} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[2_1 executing,run_mode=COOP_GROUP],dispatch=GroupTarget} / 状态 2_1 searching→executing
    SCH-->>EX: 建群+dispatch 群执行★OUT (BCS)
    OB->>TS: apply_search_result(2_5, MISS d=1)
    Note right of TS: 入参 recommendation{outcome=MISS} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[2_5 decomposing,depth=1],dispatch=OwnerTarget} / 状态 2_5 searching→decomposing (d=1<MAX)
    SCH-->>OB: dispatch 递归拆解★OUT (2_5)
    OB->>TS: add_subtasks(2_5, 2子 d=2)
    Note right of TS: 入参 parent=2_5, subtasks=[2_5_1,2_5_2] / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[2_5 spawning, 2子 searching d=2]} / 状态 2_5 decomposing→spawning; 子 ─→searching(再MISS→拆→孙d=3)
    OB->>TS: apply_search_result(孙, MISS d=3)
    Note right of TS: 入参 recommendation{outcome=MISS} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[孙 HUNG],dispatch=None} / 状态 孙 searching→HUNG; settle:propagate_hung_up 孙→父→2_5子树HUNG
    Note right of TS: 其它可执行全DONE后 graph RUNNING→HUMAN_REQUIRED (has_hung+all_exec_done)

    Note over 调用方,EX: ═══ Phase D 人工确认升BBS → BBS接力 ═══
    调用方->>TS: transition(CONFIRM_BBS)
    Note right of TS: 入参 action=CONFIRM_BBS / 出参 TaskOpResult{status=BBS_ACTIVE,seq=12} / 状态 graph HUMAN_REQUIRED→BBS_ACTIVE; HUNG叶子 hung→escalating
    SCH-->>EX: dispatch BBS悬赏★OUT (HUNG叶子)
    EX->>TS: bbs.claimed(孙, bbs_bot)
    Note right of TS: 入参 {node_id=孙, bbs_bot_id=bot_ai_train_engineer} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[孙 escalating,assignee=bbs_bot],dispatch=BotTarget} / 状态 孙 hung→escalating
    SCH-->>EX: dispatch 执行★OUT (BBS bot)
    EX->>TS: update_subtask(孙, DONE PASS)
    Note right of TS: 入参 NodeInfo{status=DONE,acceptance_result=PASS} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[孙 DONE]} / 状态 孙 escalating→DONE; settle:解除父HUNG→2_5子树闭合

    Note over 调用方,EX: ═══ Phase E 汇总3_1 (deps_met冒泡触发) ═══
    Note right of SCH: settle→drive(3_1)→enter→searching (内部,无外部API)
    SCH-->>OB: dispatch 搜推★OUT (3_1)
    OB->>TS: apply_search_result(3_1, HIT_aggregator)
    Note right of TS: 入参 recommendation{outcome=HIT,candidates=[bot_aggregator]} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[3_1 executing,assignee=bot_aggregator],dispatch=BotTarget} / 状态 3_1 searching→executing
    SCH-->>EX: dispatch 汇总★OUT (bot_aggregator)
    EX->>TS: update_subtask(3_1, DONE PASS)
    Note right of TS: 入参 NodeInfo{status=DONE,acceptance_result=PASS} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[3_1 DONE]} / 状态 3_1 executing→DONE; settle→drive(3_2)

    Note over 调用方,EX: ═══ Phase F 终验FAIL→reroute→补做→二次汇总/终验PASS ═══
    SCH-->>OB: dispatch 搜推★OUT (3_2)
    OB->>TS: apply_search_result(3_2, HIT_verifier)
    Note right of TS: 入参 recommendation{outcome=HIT,candidates=[bot_verifier]} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[3_2 executing,assignee=bot_verifier],dispatch=BotTarget} / 状态 3_2 searching→executing
    SCH-->>EX: dispatch 终验★OUT (bot_verifier)
    EX->>TS: update_subtask(3_2, FAILED gaps=缺tech)
    Note right of TS: 入参 NodeInfo{status=FAILED,acceptance_result={verdict=FAIL,gaps=[AC#3.tech]}} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[3_2 FAILED],dispatch=OwnerTarget} / 状态 3_2 executing→FAILED; handle_reject+reroute+reopen 3_1 DONE→PENDING; loop_round 0→1
    SCH-->>OB: dispatch 补拆★OUT (reroute_dec_r1)
    OB->>TS: add_subtasks(reroute_dec_r1, [2_3_tech])
    Note right of TS: 入参 parent=reroute_dec_r1, subtasks=[2_3] / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[reroute_dec DONE,2_3 searching,3_1 PENDING重开]} / 状态 reroute_dec→DONE; 2_3 ─→searching; 3_1 DONE→PENDING(重开); add edge 2_3→3_1
    SCH-->>OB: dispatch 搜推★OUT (2_3)
    OB->>TS: apply_search_result(2_3, HIT)
    Note right of TS: 入参 recommendation{outcome=HIT} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[2_3 executing],dispatch=BotTarget} / 状态 2_3 searching→executing
    SCH-->>EX: dispatch 执行★OUT (2_3)
    EX->>TS: update_subtask(2_3, DONE PASS)
    Note right of TS: 入参 NodeInfo{status=DONE,acceptance_result=PASS} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[2_3 DONE]} / 状态 2_3 executing→DONE; settle→drive(3_1 重开,deps_met)
    Note right of SCH: settle→drive(3_1二次)→enter 复用bot_aggregator→executing (内部)
    SCH-->>EX: dispatch 汇总★OUT (3_1二次, 复用bot_aggregator)
    EX->>TS: update_subtask(3_1, DONE PASS) 二次
    Note right of TS: 入参 NodeInfo{status=DONE,acceptance_result=PASS} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[3_1 DONE]} / 状态 3_1 PENDING→DONE(二次,含tech); settle→reopen 3_2 FAILED→PENDING+drive(3_2二次)
    Note right of SCH: settle→drive(3_2二次)→enter 复用bot_verifier→executing (内部)
    SCH-->>EX: dispatch 终验★OUT (3_2二次, 复用bot_verifier)
    EX->>TS: update_subtask(3_2, DONE PASS 全AC) 二次
    Note right of TS: 入参 NodeInfo{status=DONE,acceptance_result={verdict=PASS,acceptances_met=[AC#1..AC#7]}} / 出参 NodeOpResult{nodes=[3_2 DONE]} / 状态 3_2 PENDING→DONE; settle:all_done→graph RUNNING→DONE, loop_round=1
    调用方->>TS: query_task(T1) + get_history(T1)
    TS-->>调用方: TaskView{status=DONE,loop_round=1} + events[23]
